<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.2 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 3.2 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for March rose 3.2 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In February the CPI grew 3.1 percent year-on-year. The index fell 0.2 percent in March 1997 compared with a month ago.  </p>
<p> CONSUMER PRICE INDEX	March 97  Feb 97   March 96</p>
<p> Change year/year pct	  3.2	3.1	  3.2</p>
<p> Index (base year 1994)    109.3    109.5	105.9</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
